# Current-artifact edit-sized publication diagnostic

Diagnostic only. This is one paired capture, not an acceptance rerun or a causal comparison. The main arm has a highly unstable tail; do not use the pair-wide ranking to claim parity or to select a change.

## Exact workload and artifact identities

Both arms used the maintained `benchmark:edit-sized-publication-profile` workflow with `--case bulk-write --boundary publication --count 1024 --position first --warmups 10 --iterations 80 --reads none --publication-path scene`. Each timed callback performed 1,024 text setters followed by one scene publication. Timed reads were zero; correctness reads occurred after profiling. Topology was one draw and 9,216 glyphs before and after. There were 10 warmups and 80 measured callbacks per arm. No build was run. The captures ran sequentially, HELD first.

| Arm | Product archive SHA-256 | Named Wasm SHA-256 | Shipping Wasm SHA-256 | V8 profile SHA-256 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| HELD frozen06fe | `06fe22b7f05dceb27f59b2e82d33fab541c8cee04c37b1a1ccdf078f6ecdc9be` | `c94120f523f9022eaac87733822df4cf1836ad73fc4ad0228f5fdebb03ed4f36` | `66e6c46357030d8457a8568af303d8552b16a68f0c3815877d01d634996bbffb` | `0828584cddb9182933e3cc3d58f7399cf99a7785e20aa52ca3a1de6a43d4beaf` |
| Main frozen4e25 | `bbb3375c08fb3db8186ec10e4b766b7170632f7601eb1ec0e90be0197f22eb20` | `7b06007ee648bdf1ebd723ab398fd8928531901b03c56017edcb2d40e8cebe4c` | `059ab502908510109c0f66b1a5558e42b79ba843bff36b18c309ec7be8a189e4` | `caca34958cbcedd2704d16728af6e62b684aba95b1983b821a532a895ae6ef0e` |

Each postflight receipt passed the archive/manifest, named/manifest, named-executable/shipping, callback, operation-count, topology, sample-count, and p90-output identity checks. Named Wasm executable hashes match their corresponding shipping Wasm hashes. The harness input digest was `e788ebad6b5b526c8cf98e496d9f65f85b35508fcdebf61a67c64a865c40a292` for both arms. The observer-only patch was `52ebbd2f3c0538dd17aa164b8e9b18bf049fa254b184fb01ab087f174cd80e09`.

